{"suttaId":"tha-ap500","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[2702,2810],"vripara":"57"},"segments":{"tha-ap500:0.3":"Pulinathūpiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap500:1.1":"“Himavantassāvidūre, yamako nāma pabbato;","tha-ap500:1.3":"Assamo sukato mayhaṃ, paṇṇasālā sumāpitā.","tha-ap500:2.1":"“Nārado nāma nāmena, jaṭilo uggatāpano;","tha-ap500:2.3":"Catuddasasahassāni, sissā paricaranti maṃ.","tha-ap500:3.1":"“Paṭisallīnako santo, evaṃ cintesahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap500:3.3":"‘Sabbo jano maṃ pūjeti, nāhaṃ pūjemi kiñcanaṃ.","tha-ap500:4.1":"“‘Na me ovādako atthi, vattā koci na vijjati;","tha-ap500:4.3":"Anācariyupajjhāyo, vane vāsaṃ upemahaṃ.","tha-ap500:5.1":"“‘Upāsamāno yamahaṃ, garucittaṃ upaṭṭhahe;","tha-ap500:5.3":"So me ācariyo natthi, vanavāso niratthako.","tha-ap500:6.1":"“‘Āyāgaṃ me gavesissaṃ, garuṃ bhāvaniyaṃ tathā;","tha-ap500:6.3":"Sāvassayo vasissāmi, na koci garahissati’.","tha-ap500:7.1":"“Uttānakūlā nadikā, supatitthā manoramā;","tha-ap500:7.3":"Saṃsuddhapulinākiṇṇā, avidūre mamassamaṃ.","tha-ap500:8.1":"“Nadiṃ amarikaṃ nāma, upagantvānahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap500:8.3":"Saṃvaḍḍhayitvā pulinaṃ, akaṃ pulinacetiyaṃ.","tha-ap500:9.1":"“Ye te ahesuṃ sambuddhā, bhavantakaraṇā munī;","tha-ap500:9.3":"Tesaṃ etādiso thūpo, taṃ nimittaṃ karomahaṃ.","tha-ap500:10.1":"“Karitvā pulinaṃ [puḷine (sī. syā. pī.)] thūpaṃ, sovaṇṇaṃ māpayiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap500:10.3":"Soṇṇakiṅkaṇipupphāni, sahasse tīṇi pūjayiṃ.","tha-ap500:11.1":"“Sāyapātaṃ namassāmi, vedajāto katañjalī;","tha-ap500:11.3":"Sammukhā viya sambuddhaṃ, vandiṃ pulinacetiyaṃ.","tha-ap500:12.1":"“Yadā kilesā jāyanti, vitakkā gehanissitā;","tha-ap500:12.3":"Sarāmi sukataṃ thūpaṃ, paccavekkhāmi tāvade.","tha-ap500:13.1":"“Upanissāya viharaṃ, satthavāhaṃ vināyakaṃ;","tha-ap500:13.3":"Kilese saṃvaseyyāsi, na yuttaṃ tava mārisa.","tha-ap500:14.1":"“Saha āvajjite thūpe, gāravaṃ hoti me tadā;","tha-ap500:14.3":"Kuvitakke vinodesiṃ, nāgo tuttaṭṭito yathā.","tha-ap500:15.1":"“Evaṃ viharamānaṃ maṃ, maccurājābhimaddatha;","tha-ap500:15.3":"Tattha kālaṅkato santo, brahmalokamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap500:16.1":"“Yāvatāyuṃ vasitvāna, tidive [tidase (sī. pī.)] upapajjahaṃ;","tha-ap500:16.3":"Asītikkhattuṃ devindo, devarajjamakārayiṃ.","tha-ap500:17.1":"“Satānaṃ tīṇikkhattuñca, cakkavattī ahosahaṃ;","tha-ap500:17.3":"Padesarajjaṃ vipulaṃ, gaṇanāto asaṅkhiyaṃ.","tha-ap500:18.1":"“Soṇṇakiṅkaṇipupphānaṃ [tesaṃ kiṅkaṇipupphānaṃ (sī.)], vipākaṃ anubhomahaṃ;","tha-ap500:18.3":"Dhātīsatasahassāni, parivārenti maṃ [me (ka.)] bhave.","tha-ap500:19.1":"“Thūpassa pariciṇṇattā, rajojallaṃ na limpati;","tha-ap500:19.3":"Gatte sedā na muccanti, suppabhāso bhavāmahaṃ.","tha-ap500:20.1":"“Aho me sukato thūpo, sudiṭṭhāmarikā nadī;","tha-ap500:20.3":"Thūpaṃ katvāna pulinaṃ, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap500:21.1":"“Kusalaṃ kattukāmena, jantunā sāragāhinā;","tha-ap500:21.3":"Natthi khettaṃ akhettaṃ vā, paṭipattīva sādhakā [sārikā (pī.), sārakā (syā.), sāratā (ka.)].","tha-ap500:22.1":"“Yathāpi balavā poso, aṇṇavaṃ taritussahe;","tha-ap500:22.3":"Parittaṃ kaṭṭhamādāya, pakkhandeyya mahāsaraṃ.","tha-ap500:23.1":"“Imāhaṃ kaṭṭhaṃ nissāya, tarissāmi mahodadhiṃ;","tha-ap500:23.3":"Ussāhena vīriyena, tareyya udadhiṃ naro.","tha-ap500:24.1":"“Tatheva me kataṃ kammaṃ, parittaṃ thokakañca yaṃ;","tha-ap500:24.3":"Taṃ kammaṃ upanissāya, saṃsāraṃ samatikkamiṃ.","tha-ap500:25.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, sukkamūlena codito;","tha-ap500:25.3":"Sāvatthiyaṃ pure jāto, mahāsāle suaḍḍhake.","tha-ap500:26.1":"“Saddhā mātā pitā mayhaṃ, buddhassa saraṇaṃ gatā;","tha-ap500:26.3":"Ubho diṭṭhapadā ete, anuvattanti sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap500:27.1":"“Bodhipapaṭikaṃ gayha, soṇṇathūpamakārayuṃ;","tha-ap500:27.3":"Sāyapātaṃ [sāyaṃ pātaṃ (syā. ka.)] namassanti, sakyaputtassa sammukhā.","tha-ap500:28.1":"“Uposathamhi divase, soṇṇathūpaṃ vinīharuṃ;","tha-ap500:28.3":"Buddhassa vaṇṇaṃ kittentā, tiyāmaṃ vītināmayuṃ.","tha-ap500:29.1":"“Saha disvānahaṃ [pasādetvānahaṃ (ka.)] thūpaṃ, sariṃ pulinacetiyaṃ;","tha-ap500:29.3":"Ekāsane nisīditvā, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.","tha-ap500:30.1":"Dvāvīsatimaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ.","tha-ap500:31.1":"“Gavesamāno taṃ vīraṃ, dhammasenāpatiddasaṃ;","tha-ap500:31.3":"Agārā nikkhamitvāna, pabbajiṃ tassa santike.","tha-ap500:32.1":"“Jātiyā sattavassena, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ;","tha-ap500:32.3":"Upasampādayī buddho, guṇamaññāya cakkhumā.","tha-ap500:33.1":"“Dārakeneva santena, kiriyaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ mayā;","tha-ap500:33.3":"Kataṃ me karaṇīyajja, sakyaputtassa sāsane.","tha-ap500:34.1":"“Sabbaverabhayātīto, sabbasaṅgātigo [sabbasaṅkātito (ka.)] isi;","tha-ap500:34.3":"Sāvako te mahāvīra, soṇṇathūpassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap500:35.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap500:36.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap500:37.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap500:38.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā pulinathūpiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap500:39.1":"Pulinathūpiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
